WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Many business owners have clear ideas,
products, market and vision

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.500
But the problem is, who will make the
website, who will handle the Instagram, who

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
will design the label

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
What about the launch sequence and
consistency?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
recently while working with a pet care brand

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.000
I saw exactly the same

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.000
founder had a vision

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.000
we made a website

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.000
started Instagram

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.000
made a label of 9 products

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
created an execution structure for the
launch

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
We designed labels for nine products.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.240
they don't just need advice, they need
someone who can tell them to execute this

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.360
and this is my role in Shikha Solutions

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:44.080
They need someone alongside them to help
turn ideas into execution.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.000
I will answer 3 questions

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
If your business is running but execution
has gaps, comment GAP.

